        <p>
          Intumescent fire resistant paints are sophisticated, highly engineered chemical systems rather than simple coatings. Developing these products requires a deep understanding of polymer science, heat transfer thermodynamics, reaction kinetics, and strict global fire certification standards.
        </p>
        <p>
          To succeed in this high-margin market, manufacturers must prioritize scientific formulation development and strict process control. Partnering with specialized R&amp;D and engineering consultants helps minimize technical risks and accelerates the path to certified commercial production.
        </p>
